    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43772" root="&#xA;                        موى&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاوِيَّةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A mirror;</i> so called in relation to water,
because of its clearness, and because images are
seen in it as they are in clear water: the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span> is a
radical letter. (T in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوى</span>.)

